# @kiichan/design-system

Shared UI package for Kiichan apps. Atomic design + Storybook. Distributed by GitHub tag.

- Read `AGENTS.md` before making changes.
- Search existing atoms/molecules/organisms before adding a component.
- New public API: component folder + `index.ts` + re-export in `src/index.ts` + Storybook story.
- No app business logic in this package.
- SemVer: breaking → major; new components → minor; fixes → patch. Release only via `pnpm release:*` on `master`.
- Consumers upgrade by editing `#vX.Y.Z` in their `package.json`, then `pnpm install` — do not recommend unreliable CLI tag installs.
